; Exercise D.3: SET, LD, SUB, then BZ. With -t, the trace shows where
; the machine goes after the branch.

        SET R5, 3       ; the prior result is R5
        LD R5           ; R0 := 3; the prior result is R0
        SUB R5          ; R0 := 0
        BZ taken        ; tests R0
        RTN
taken:  RTN
